&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C5472%2C3639&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Zw46rIF3NbkBXcAl_ProtegaGummedPaperTapeCloseup.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C5472%2C3639&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Zw46rIF3NbkBXcAl_ProtegaGummedPaperTapeCloseup.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C5472%2C3639&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Protega logo on a cardboard box" width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>In partnership with Protega</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Protega Global are a company dedicated to eliminating packaging pollution. Helping businesses reduce their reliance on plastic, improve sustainability, and enhance efficiency. By manufacturing Hexcel Wrap and Protega products in-house, they have also managed to keep costs low to make planet-friendly products accessible to businesses of any scale.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Protega’s manufacturing also takes place completely within the UK to facilitate a secure supply chain that further reduces the carbon footprint. Cost-effective and user-friendly, we couldn’t have picked a better company to partner with to join us on our net-zero mission. Switching to paper packaging is also a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://protega-global.com/2022/02/08/paper-and-plastic-packaging-pros-and-cons/#:~:text=Paper%20packaging%20is%20also%20an,paper%20communicates%20your%20sustainable%20values." rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->great way to promote brand ethos<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> as an environmentally focussed business. Start ordering Protega packaging through Evri to make a stand as a business and go green.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Order sustainable packaging" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="https://evri.protega-global.com/customerportal/productcatalogue?ReturnUrl=%2FCore%2FDashboard" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Order sustainable packaging<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--siz