o/ev-mercury/Zx-bhK8jQArTz5c0_HexcelandProtega-12.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C6%2C4838%2C3217&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A person wrapping an item in Hexcel wrap" width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Hexcel Range – a paper-based alternative to plastic bubble wrap</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A brilliant new innovation made from recycled FSC® paper, Hexcel offers the protection of bubble wrap without the need for plastic waste. Manufactured entirely in the UK, the interlocking design of Hexcel means that you don’t even need tape to secure it around an item. Don’t let your dedication to net-zero compromise the safety of your product – use Hexcel to protect your product throughout its journey. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For non-fragile items, you can use HexaFil to fill voids and reduce movement in a box. Recycled FSC® paper and manufactured in the UK, a perfect solution to cut down on waste materials like packing peanuts. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Purchase Hexcel wrap and HexaFil" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="https://evri.protega-global.com/customerportal/productcatalogue?ReturnUrl=%2FCore%2FDashboard" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg heigh