re. See our range!","purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fpurchase-sustainable-packaging",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"YhjzRRIAAC8A3CHH","subpath1",[],"en-gb","our-services","2022-02-25T15:18:32+0000","Document","090e06ab-fb4d-4029-b67d-5183a796c88b",false,{"link_type":18},[23,58,88,117,227,249,267,319],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":27,"id":56,"slice_type":57,"slice_label":28},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[],{"theme":28,"PageHeaderTitle":29,"PageHeaderText":30,"PageHeaderCtaText":36,"PageHeaderCtaUrl":37,"secondaryCtaText":28,"secondaryCtaLabel":28,"secondaryCtaUrl":41,"PageHeaderImage":43,"heroImage":54,"videoContent":55,"showPremiumLogo":28},null,"Purchase sustainable packaging",[31],{"type":32,"text":33,"spans":34,"direction":35},"paragraph","To support our customers in their sustainability efforts, Evri has launched an online packaging store",[],"ltr","Order sustainable packaging today",{"link_type":38,"key":39,"url":40},"Web","0532e4c0-74a3-47f6-ac3d-aebace54fbd6","purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fevri.protega-global.com\u002Fcustomerportal\u002Fproductcatalogue?ReturnUrl=%2FCore%2FDashboard",{"link_type":42},"Any",{"dimensions":44,"alt":47,"copyright":28,"url":48,"id":49,"edit":50},{"width":45,"height":46},545,154,"Evri logo","purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd138ab89-a548-4980-82ae-9d5d9cd328b4_evri-heart.svg","Yh9I_RIAACoA-LzO",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$744c5c58-14f7-4ccf-befe-641e550a3703","page_header",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":59,"primary":60,"id":86,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":28},[],{"CardImage":61,"CardAvatar":70,"CardTitle":71,"CardText":72,"ButtonText":28,"ButtonUrl":85,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":62,"alt":65,"copyright":28,"url":66,"id":67,"edit":68},{"width":63,"height":64},1000,665,"A mother and child thanking their Evri Courier after a satisfactory delivery of two parcels","purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6the5bqstJ9-e-A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6364.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6the5bqstJ9-e-A",{"x":51,"y":69,"zoom":52,"background":53},8,"none","Affordable and sustainable packaging delivered to you",[73],{"type":32,"text":74,"spans":75,"direction":35},"For our businesses and eco-conscious senders, we are thrilled to be able to offer a sustainable and cost-effective solution to your packaging. With a simple online portal, customers can place single or bulk orders for shipping supplies of all kinds, including boxes, tape, a paper alternative to plastic bubble wrap, mailing bags and much more. Thanks to Evri’s partnership with Protega Global, your packaging doesn’t have to cost the earth. Our journey towards net-zero emissions continues with this amazing new offering being the next step. Choose sustainable packaging today and discover innovative, cost-effective solutions for all your parcel shipping needs.",[76,83],{"start":77,"end":78,"type":79,"data":80},462,480,"hyperlink",{"link_type":38,"url":81,"target":82},"purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fprotega-global.com\u002F2024\u002F04\u002F16\u002Flife-cycle-assessment-of-paper-packaging-vs-plastic-packaging\u002F","_self",{"start":77,"end":78,"type":84},"strong",{"link_type":42},"card$e998f319-9709-4861-b826-2eb3f2711613","card",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":89,"primary":90,"id":116,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":28},[],{"CardImage":91,"CardAvatar":70,"CardTitle":98,"CardText":99,"ButtonText":113,"ButtonUrl":114,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":92,"alt":93,"copyright":28,"url":94,"id":95,"edit":96},{"width":63,"height":64},"Protega logo on a cardboard box","purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZw46rIF3NbkBXcAl_ProtegaGummedPaperTapeCloseup.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C5%2C5472%2C3639&w=1000&h=665","Zw46rIF3NbkBXcAl",{"x":51,"y":97,"zoom":52,"background":53},5,"In partnership with Protega",[100,103],{"type":32,"text":101,"spans":102,"direction":35},"Protega Global are a company dedicated to eliminating packaging pollution. Helping businesses reduce their reliance on plastic, improve sustainability, and enhance efficiency. By manufacturing Hexcel Wrap and Protega products in-house, they have also managed to keep costs low to make planet-friendly products accessible to businesses of any scale.",[],{"type":32,"text":104,"spans":105,"direction":35},"Protega’s manufacturing also takes place completely within the UK to facilitate a secure supply chain that further reduces the carbon footprint. Cost-effective and user-friendly, we couldn’t have picked a better company to partner with to join us on our net-zero mission. Switching to paper packaging is also a great way to promote brand ethos as an environmentally focussed business. Start ordering Protega packaging through Evri to make a stand as a business and go green.",[106,112],{"start":107,"end":108,"type":79,"data":109},311,343,{"link_type":38,"url":110,"target":111},"purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fprotega-global.com\u002F2022\u002F02\u002F08\u002Fpaper-and-plastic-packaging-pros-and-cons\u002F#:~:text=Paper%20packaging%20is%20also%20an,paper%20communicates%20your%20sustainable%20values.","_blank",{"start":107,"end":108,"type":84},"Order sustainable packaging",{"link_type":38,"key":115,"url":40},"4db44497-4d57-4e56-a4b8-914b5d658fda","card$add8976f-5497-4edc-8507-5c59113b8be7",{"variation":118,"version":25,"items":119,"primary":215,"id":225,"slice_type":226,"slice_label":28},"3ColumnWithoutLinks",[120,136,153,167,181,198],{"Title":121,"Description":126,"Image":130,"Label":28},[122],{"type":123,"text":124,"spans":125,"direction":35},"heading3","Single wall reinforced carton",[],[127],{"type":32,"text":128,"spans":129,"direction":35},"Product code: CB16 - 406mm x 406mm x 406mm",[],{"dimensions":131,"alt":132,"copyright":28,"url":133,"id":134,"edit":135},{"width":63,"height":64},"Image of the featured box","purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZw5QgoF3NbkBXdRZ_ProductPhotos_0004_cb16.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1%2C2000%2C1330&w=1000&h=665","Zw5QgoF3NbkBXdRZ",{"x":51,"y":52,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"Title":137,"Description":141,"Image":145,"Label":28},[138],{"type":123,"text":139,"spans":140,"direction":35},"Single wall carton",[],[142],{"type":32,"text":143,"spans":144,"direction":35},"Product code: S5 - 125mm x 125mm x 125mm",[],{"dimensions":146,"alt":132,"copyright":28,"url":147,"id":148,"edit":149},{"width":63,"height":64},"purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZw5QgYF3NbkBXdRY_ProductPhotos_0003_S5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=353%2C181%2C1351%2C898&w=1000&h=665","Zw5QgYF3NbkBXdRY",{"x":150,"y":151,"zoom":152,"background":53},353,181,1.48,{"Title":154,"Description":158,"Image":162,"Label":28},[155],{"type":123,"text":156,"spans":157,"direction":35},"Postal box",[],[159],{"type":32,"text":160,"spans":161,"direction":35},"Product code: T22280 - 251mm x 178mm x 90mm",[],{"dimensions":163,"alt":132,"copyright":28,"url":164,"id":165,"edit":166},{"width":63,"height":64},"purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZx9kya8jQArTz3-b_T22280.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1%2C2000%2C1330&w=1000&h=665","Zx9kya8jQArTz3-b",{"x":51,"y":52,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"Title":168,"Description":172,"Image":176,"Label":28},[169],{"type":123,"text":170,"spans":171,"direction":35},"Padded paper mailing bag",[],[173],{"type":32,"text":174,"spans":175,"direction":35},"Product code: PB5 - 247mm x 387mm",[],{"dimensions":177,"alt":132,"copyright":28,"url":178,"id":179,"edit":180},{"width":63,"height":64},"purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZx9p3q8jQArTz4Cr_PB5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1%2C2000%2C1330&w=1000&h=665","Zx9p3q8jQArTz4Cr",{"x":51,"y":52,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"Title":182,"Description":186,"Image":190,"Label":28},[183],{"type":123,"text":184,"spans":185,"direction":35},"Fluted capacity mailer",[],[187],{"type":32,"text":188,"spans":189,"direction":35},"Product code: T22684 - A5 343mm x 234mm",[],{"dimensions":191,"alt":132,"copyright":28,"url":192,"id":193,"edit":194},{"width":63,"height":64},"purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZx9pxK8jQArTz4Co_ProductPhotos_0007_t22684.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=219%2C147%2C1563%2C1039&w=1000&h=665","Zx9pxK8jQArTz4Co",{"x":195,"y":196,"zoom":197,"background":53},219,147,1.28,{"Title":199,"Description":203,"Image":207,"Label":28},[200],{"type":123,"text":201,"spans":202,"direction":35},"Kraft paper mailing bag",[],[204],{"type":32,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":35},"Product code: PM2 - 325mm x 100mm x 420mm",[],{"dimensions":208,"alt":132,"copyright":28,"url":209,"id":210,"edit":211},{"width":63,"height":64},"purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZx9pw68jQArTz4Cn_ProductPhotos_0011_PM2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=93%2C17%2C1802%2C1198&w=1000&h=665","Zx9pw68jQArTz4Cn",{"x":212,"y":213,"zoom":214,"background":53},93,17,1.11,{"SectionTitle":216,"SectionDescription":221,"theme":28},[217],{"type":218,"text":219,"spans":220,"direction":35},"heading2","Purchase sustainable boxes for your parcels",[],[222],{"type":32,"text":223,"spans":224,"direction":35},"Made from 70% recycled material and being 100% recyclable and biodegradable, Protega’s line of parcel boxes offer sturdy protection for your products without costing the Earth. All boxes are FSC-certified and offer extra protection, well suited for the delivery of fragile goods. Check out just a few examples of the incredible products on offer:",[],"article_link_module$866ddd85-70d5-4b7f-abda-c684c3819b3e","article_link_module",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":228,"primary":229,"id":248,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":28},[],{"CardImage":230,"CardAvatar":70,"CardTitle":237,"CardText":238,"ButtonText":245,"ButtonUrl":246,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":231,"alt":232,"copyright":28,"url":233,"id":234,"edit":235},{"width":63,"height":64},"A person wrapping an item in Hexcel wrap","purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZx-bhK8jQArTz5c0_HexcelandProtega-12.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C6%2C4838%2C3217&w=1000&h=665","Zx-bhK8jQArTz5c0",{"x":51,"y":236,"zoom":52,"background":53},6,"Hexcel Range – a paper-based alternative to plastic bubble wrap",[239,242],{"type":32,"text":240,"spans":241,"direction":35},"A brilliant new innovation made from recycled FSC® paper, Hexcel offers the protection of bubble wrap without the need for plastic waste. Manufactured entirely in the UK, the interlocking design of Hexcel means that you don’t even need tape to secure it around an item. Don’t let your dedication to net-zero compromise the safety of your product – use Hexcel to protect your product throughout its journey. ",[],{"type":32,"text":243,"spans":244,"direction":35},"For non-fragile items, you can use HexaFil to fill voids and reduce movement in a box. Recycled FSC® paper and manufactured in the UK, a perfect solution to cut down on waste materials like packing peanuts. ",[],"Purchase Hexcel wrap and HexaFil",{"link_type":38,"key":247,"url":40},"55827297-1314-486c-9c07-c3a1207e04d9","card$514f27ed-f581-4ec1-a007-7d5aa8c8350b",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":250,"primary":251,"id":266,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":28},[],{"CardImage":252,"CardAvatar":70,"CardTitle":258,"CardText":259,"ButtonText":263,"ButtonUrl":264,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":253,"alt":28,"copyright":28,"url":254,"id":255,"edit":256},{"width":63,"height":64},"purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZw5LSoF3NbkBXdJL_ProtegaPaperMachine-PackingStationUpHigh-DSC04280.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C316%2C1080%2C718&w=1000&h=665","Zw5LSoF3NbkBXdJL",{"x":51,"y":257,"zoom":52,"background":53},316,"Ship your parcels securely with these supplies",[260],{"type":32,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":35},"Purchase a wide variety of tapes, labels, mailers and more to cover all of your parcel sending needs all in one online portal. Thanks to UK based in-house manufacturing and a local supply chain, by ordering all of your products in one place you can invest in innovative paper-based packaging solutions whilst cutting costs. This is possible because of a secure supply chain, optimising storage space, reducing disruptions and ensuring reliable delivery by an Evri courier. Check out Protega's range of packaging supplies.",[],"Purchase packaging supplies",{"link_type":38,"key":265,"url":40},"1195c461-6b59-42be-b6f0-094a5f9bb375","card$d3a86e5f-3791-4185-a25d-32276da1d9a1",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":268,"primary":269,"id":318,"slice_type":87,"slice_label":28},[],{"CardImage":270,"CardAvatar":70,"CardTitle":276,"CardText":277,"ButtonText":307,"ButtonUrl":308,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":271,"alt":272,"copyright":28,"url":273,"id":274,"edit":275},{"width":63,"height":64},"An older man is wrapping a parcel. He is applying the label with tape.","purchase-sustainable-packaging.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oyq5bqstJ9-cWy_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C7822%2C5202&w=1000&h=665","Z6oyq5bqstJ9-cWy",{"x":51,"y":69,"zoom":52,"background":53},"How to wrap a parcel",[278],{"type":32,"text":279,"spans":280,"direction":35},"Want to make the most out of your wonderful new supply of sustainable packaging? In our guide on how to wrap a parcel, we take you through 6 simple steps to get your products packaged securely ready for transit. If you’re looking to send a heavy parcel or you’re packaging fragile items, we have guides for those too! Through vans and sorting hubs, across conveyor belts, your parcel will arrive as you left it provided it is wrapped and labelled according to our guidance.",[281,294,295,306],{"start":282,"end":283,"type":79,"data":284},233,252,{"id":285,"type":286,"tags":287,"lang":15,"slug":289,"first_publication_date":290,"last_publication_date":291,"uid":292,"url":293,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"ZL6GbxEAACIADZXm","content-page",[288],"Guides","how-to-send-a-heavy-package--packaging-heavy-items--evri","2023-07-24T14:31:08+0000","2025-02-26T12:31:27+0000","how-to-send-a-heavy-package","\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-a-heavy-package",{"start":282,"end":283,"type":84},{"start":296,"end":297,"type":79,"data":298},263,286,{"id":299,"type":286,"tags":300,"lang":15,"slug":301,"first_publication_date":302,"last_publication_date":303,"uid":304,"url":305,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"ZLkrSxEAACIA9k4Y",[288],"packaging-fragile-items-for-shipping--fragile-parcels--evri","2023-07-25T13:34:59+0000","2025-02-24T12:42:47+0000","easy-steps-to-packaging-fragile-items","\u002Fguides\u002Feasy-steps-to-packaging-fragile-items",{"start":296,"end":297,"type":84},"Learn how to wrap a parcel",{"id":309,"type":286,"tags":310,"lang":15,"slug":312,"first_publication_date":313,"last_publication_date":314,"uid":315,"url":316,"link_type":18,"key":317,"isBroken":20},"YhZIwRIAACkA0WHg",[311],"Send a Parcel","httpswww.evri.comsendhow-to-wrap-a-parcel","2022-02-23T14:46:29+0000","2026-05-06T10:12:26+0000","how-to-wrap-a-parcel","\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel","22a11ee2-154e-4223-81c5-693bead79319","card$d67b4d4a-05a6-434f-9336-d55eae71d434",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":320,"primary":349,"id":351,"slice_type":352,"slice_label":28},[321,332,338],{"questionTitle":322,"questionBody":323},"How long does the packaging take to ship?",[324],{"type":32,"text":325,"spans":326,"direction":35},"All packaging ordered via our Sustainable Packaging Ordering Portal is carried by Evri and shipped within 2-4 days.",[327,331],{"start":328,"end":329,"type":79,"data":330},30,67,{"link_type":38,"url":40,"target":111},{"start":328,"end":329,"type":84},{"questionTitle":333,"questionBody":334},"How much is shipping?",[335],{"type":32,"text":336,"spans":337,"direction":35},"Orders over £50 are eligible for free shipping! Orders up to this amount will be charged a £7.50 carriage fee. ",[],{"questionTitle":339,"questionBody":340},"Can I get regular packaging shipments for my business?",[341],{"type":32,"text":342,"spans":343,"direction":35},"Enquire on the Sustainable Packaging Ordering Portal today to set up an account for frequent orders!",[344,348],{"start":345,"end":346,"type":79,"data":347},15,52,{"link_type":38,"url":40,"target":111},{"start":345,"end":346,"type":84},{"title":350},"Frequently Asked Questions","frequently_asked_questions$3acb2bce-15c3-4a58-aae6-4bdff2a9817e","frequently_asked_questions",[23,58,88,117,227,249,267,319],["Reactive",355],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":356,"$sclients":423,"$sglobal-basket-count":28},{"abtasty":357,"accessibe":361,"appPromoBanner":364,"autoDivertUpdates":367,"awin":370,"bulkInternational":373,"bulkSendEnabled":376,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":379,"enableBasketCount":382,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":385,"euCustomsDuty":388,"groovyAdvert":391,"newInternationalSendFlow":394,"newinternationalpages":401,"oohPreferenceFlag":405,"opentel":408,"premium":411,"savedCards":414,"smallParcelSize":417,"yourPricesDrawer":420},{"_createdAt":358,"_updatedAt":359,"enabled":360},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":362,"_updatedAt":363,"enabled":360},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":365,"_updatedAt":366,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":368,"_updatedAt":369,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_creat